<title>USA: Nanometrics sees FY96 shr $0.46.</title>
<headline>Nanometrics sees FY96 shr $0.46.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nanometrics Inc said Thursday it expects to report annual revenues of more than $30 million and net income of $3.9 million or $0.46 per share for 1996.  </p>
<p>The company said prior year revenues were $22.8 million and net income of $2.0 million or $0.24 per share, adjusted to exclude a $2.3 million nonrecurring favorable impact on prior year taxes from a change in its deferred tax valuation allowance.</p>
<p>Without the adjustements, the company posted net income of $4.3 million, or $0.52 per share.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
